The best-known settings are **not directly implementable as an independent one-beam rule**. Their power is a joint function of simultaneous mode thresholds and realised cross-gains for the other co-channel beams in an interference-connected component. The diagnostic also selects modes with realised boundary outcomes while optimizing the full 30.08 s tape. A deployable replacement would need causal channel estimates and joint component coordination. This is concrete work a learned coordinator could attempt, but the result does not establish that learning is necessary or that it would recover the oracle value.

