/home/sat/mcrl-v025-probe-ws-acmfix-BROKEN-stale-runner/.scratch/multi-catfish-v024-regime-b-design/PREREG-V024-REGIME-B-DRAFT-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-2026-09-08.md:183:Stage A：每 source learner 100 epochs、三初始化；兩頭200 route updates、三頭300、set 100。Validation 僅報 prediction，不選 checkpoint。Stage B：4 worlds×3 lineages×10 steps，八 arms＋teacher diagnostics。Stage C：八 arms×三 lineages×3,000完整 fixed-policy episodes，共72,000 episodes，policy 不更新。
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-selector-ws/PROVISIONING-ADVERSARIAL-2026-09-10.md:86:Arithmetic over the hash-verified [24,000-row receipt](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-beam-ws/.scratch/beamwidth/per-user-metric.json) reproduces every target flag using `bits >= 50,000,000 × (47 × 0.640) = 1,504,000,000 bits`, with zero mismatches. All 12,000 original-rule rows fail. The largest original average rate is 44.67646 Mbit/s; even a 30-second divisor leaves it below 45 Mbit/s. This is not a near-equality measurement accident.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-selector-ws/PROVISIONING-ADVERSARIAL-2026-09-10.md:88:The [dense endpoint](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-beam-ws/src/mcrl/physics_v025/batch.py:403) credits transmitted-mode SE only after decoding, applies the TDM fraction once and integrates per-user bits. The [separate scalar reconstruction](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-beam-ws/.scratch/beamwidth/per_user_metric.py:137) uses the same physical quantities. Energy attribution is downstream of the bits-based attainment flag. At uncapped nominal equality, selecting below the lowest-threshold mode meeting the required SE cannot meet that SE; the reported original census finds insufficient SE in all 846,846 decoded attempts.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-selector-ws/PROVISIONING-ADVERSARIAL-2026-09-10.md:119:Finally, 2,000 means twenty user-anchor populations of 100, not 2,000 independent people; the 12,000 sweep results reuse users, steps and arms across five widths. Transmission counts additionally repeat boundaries and slot subdivisions. They are census denominators, not independent samples establishing narrow confidence bounds. The searches maximise fixed-price `B − η_ref E` at boundary zero and commit across 48 boundaries, with a bounded joint catalogue and no deployment deadline in these diagnostics. A positive selection certificate need not imply a positive committed EE gap. The [per-user metric report](/home/sat/mcrl-v023-codex-audits/parallel-20260909/PER-USER-METRIC-2026-09-10.md) preserves the pooled gap's sign under both energy allocations, so changing attribution does not rescue the negative narrow-width result. None of these diagnostics establishes a population-wide, learned or deployable coordination claim.
