/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-fable-ws/controller-records/V025-CONTROLLER-ADJUDICATION-R11B-MARGIN-RULE-2026-09-09.md:23:1. **The link budget I quoted belongs to a different geometry.** The engine report's 19.196747 dB and 9.851770 dB are the **550 km boresight** and **1,100 km half-power edge** cases. The mechanism figure is fixed at **2,000 km, 10 degrees**. Recomputed from the figure's own constants, C/N at the 1.65 W cap is **5.714 dB at boresight and 2.703 dB at the edge**. I quoted the first pair as though it described the second geometry.
