/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-fable-ws/controller-records/11b.md:7:There is also an important correction to the numerical premise: **the package’s 19.2/9.9 dB values are not the link closure for the figure’s 2,000-km geometry.** Using the supplied figure’s constants, I obtain approximately **5.71 dB at boresight and 2.70 dB at the half-power edge**. This materially changes the answer about higher-order modulation.
